1
00:00:00,417 --> 00:00:06,000
Start with a four by four square. Two strips add twelve tiles each, bringing the total to forty.

2
00:00:10,417 --> 00:00:16,125
Slide one strip to the right side and the other below. The empty corner is three tiles by three.

3
00:00:20,417 --> 00:00:26,833
Nine tiles close the gap. Forty plus nine makes forty-nine, a square with seven tiles on each side.
